# Platform isolation (RAE)

**Canonical rules live in the repo root** (not `~/.cursor`):

- `.cursor/rules/rae-platform-isolation.mdc`
- `.cursor/rules/rae-parallel-agents.mdc`
- `.cursor/rules/rae-shared-glb-policy.mdc`
- `.cursor/rules/rae-viewport-isolation.mdc`
- `.cursor/skills/rae-platform-islands/SKILL.md`

Read `rae/AGENTS.md` and **`rae/docs/agents/platform-isolation-contract.md`** before editing this tree.

**Quick rules:** no cross-platform imports; duplicate GLB + viewport policy per island; scaffold with `scripts/scaffold_platform.py`; run `pytest -m <id>` + `tests/test_platform_isolation_contract.py`.
